      <title>School of Social Work Annual Food Drive at Lindsay Hall (Inabel Burns Lindsay Hall - School of Social Work)</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<div>  <img src="https://localist-images.azureedge.net/photos/54242445699988/huge/a8953deba0d681de15f253ce13f5c91599233211.jpg" style="width: 100%;" />  <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #555;"><strong>Sun, 25 Oct 2026</strong></div>  <div><p>The school of Social Work, in partnership with the School of Social Work Alumni Association, invites you to support our Annual Food Drive benefiting the Nourish HU Food Pantry. Now through November 20, we are collecting non-perishable food and personal care essentials to help keep the pantry stocked and accessible to Howard University students. Donations may be dropped off Monday through Friday, from 9:00 a.m. to 5:00 p.m., at the Howard University School of Social Work, 601 Howard Place NW, Washington, DC 20059, or purchased directly through our Amazon Registry. We encourage alumni, faculty, staff, students, families, friends, and community partners to join us in filling the shelves and strengthening this important campus resource.</p>

